{{#if isRest}}---
description: Data Transfer Object (DTO) Guidelines
globs: "**/*.dto.ts"
alwaysApply: true
---
- Use class-validator decorators for input validation:
  ```ts
  @IsString()
  @MinLength(2)
  name: string;
  ```
- Apply Swagger decorators for API documentation:
  ```ts
  @ApiProperty({ description: 'User name', example: 'John Doe' })
  name: string;
  ```
- Create separate DTOs for different operations: CreateUserDto, UpdateUserDto, UserResponseDto
- Use proper TypeScript types and make fields optional/required as needed
- Group related DTOs in dto/ directory when there are multiple
- Extend base DTOs when appropriate using inheritance
@dto-template.ts{{/if}}
